    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the kitchen, Senya proudly displays a whole fresh stellate sturgeon awarded to him for his honesty. Seconds later, supplier Timur asks for the spoiled fish from the trash, and Senya charges him five hundred rubles for it.",
